Ani

We're FINALLY building our mountain home! We've been dreaming about this Mountain Modern view home for 20 years. And now we're under way!  

My background is in construction, and although this channel is filled with building adorable cabins, sheds, studios, and barn-loft offices, it's time to build OUR home, from scratch, mostly by myself. It won't be fast or easy, but I'm building this house, one way or another.

